a963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七十三岁作","author":"苏辙","text":"一生有志恨无才，久尔萧萧白发催。\n力学当年真自信，初心到此未应回。\n旧人化去浑无几，新障重生拨不开。\n七十三年还住否，获麟后事转难裁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":78341,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七十吟","author":"苏辙","text":"年来霜雪上人头，俄尔相将七十秋。\n欲去天公未遣去，久留敝宅恐难留。\n六窗渐暗犹牵物，一点微明更著油。\n近听老卢亲下种，满田宿草费锄耰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":78342,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七夕","author":"苏辙","text":"火流知节换，秋到喜身安。\n林鹊真安往，河桥晚未完。\n得闲心不厌，求巧老应难。\n送酒谁知我，瓢樽昨暮乾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":78343,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日三首 其一","author":"苏辙","text":"九日真佳节，年年长赋诗。\n深惭鹤发老，每与菊花期。\n帽落无人拾，酒狂聊自持。\n丰年馀社瓮，天意念衰羸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":78344,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日三首 其三","author":"苏辙","text":"从古重此日，今人那得违。\n菊迟知岁闰，酒贵念人饥。\n身安且自慰，家远不成归。\n尚忆少年乐，惊呼人尽非。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":78345,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日三首 其一","author":"苏辙","text":"早岁寡欢意，衰年仍病缠。\n客居逢九日，斗酒破千钱。\n萸菊惊秋晚，儿孙慰目前。\n登高懒不出，多酌任颓然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":78346,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日三首 其一","author":"苏辙","text":"瓢尊空挂壁，九日若为欢。\n白发逃无计，黄花开已阑。\n酒悭惭对客，风起任飘冠。\n赖有陶翁伴，贫居得自宽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":78347,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日三首 其一","author":"苏辙","text":"昔忝衣冠旧，今从野老游。\n篱根菊初绽，瓮面酒新刍。\n不负重阳节，都无举世忧。\n人生定谁是，万事本悠悠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":78348,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日三首 其三","author":"苏辙","text":"河朔今将到，山阳近欲行。\n老怀惊聚散，一酌慰平生。\n陋巷连墙久，长淮照眼明。\n到官纷讼牒，应忆此时情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":78349,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日三首 其二","author":"苏辙","text":"我饮不为酒，黄花竞此时。\n茱萸谩辟恶，曲糵助和脾。\n浅酌何劳诉，独醒徒尔为。\n来年我犹健，相对亦如斯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":78350,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日三首 其二","author":"苏辙","text":"欲就九日饮，旋炊三斗醅。\n今朝不一醉，坐客有空回。\n白发何须吝，黄花恨晚开。\n问知瓶未罄，相劝尽馀杯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":78351,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日三首 其二","author":"苏辙","text":"解衣换村酒，酒薄不须嫌。\n节到勿空过，杯行且强拈。\n得闲身尚健，适意事难兼。\n醉卧南窗日，谁知酸与甜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":78352,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日三首 其二","author":"苏辙","text":"狂夫老无赖，见逐便忘归。\n小酌还成醉，侨居不觉非。\n妻孥应念我，风雨未缝衣。\n忧患十年足，何时赋式微。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":78353,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日三首 其三","author":"苏辙","text":"黄菊与秋竞，白须随日添。\n时人知不憙，野老未相嫌。\n但酌清樽尽，犹存薄俸沾。\n日西闻客至，更问酒家帘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":78354,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]